<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-blob"></div>
  <div class="container page-hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow-tag">Our story</div>
    <h1>Formulated with <em>patience</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Petalé started as a two-person kitchen experiment and grew into a small-batch skincare studio that still tests every formula on real skin before it ships.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-body container">
  <div class="about-grid reveal-stagger">
    <div class="value-card">
      <h4>Why we started</h4>
      <p>We were tired of routines with fifteen steps and ingredient lists we couldn't pronounce. Petalé is what we wished existed: fewer products, formulated properly, that actually do what they say.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <h4>How we formulate</h4>
      <p>Every product goes through months of small-batch testing before it's considered finished. We'd rather launch one thing that works than five things that sort of do.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:34px;">
    <h2>What we <em>believe</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="values-grid reveal-stagger">
    <div class="value-card">
      <h4>Skin first</h4>
      <p>No formula ships until it's gentle enough for sensitive skin, not just "clinically tested."</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <h4>Honest ingredients</h4>
      <p>Full ingredient lists, always. No proprietary blends hiding behind trademarked names.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <h4>Small batches</h4>
      <p>We make less, more often, so nothing sits in a warehouse losing potency.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
